# Saved Data Explorer: a read-only look at TwichUI's own saved data, its backups and the exact share Send makes, with an
# opt-in advanced cleanup (Cleanup.lua decides what may be removed and how). The window uses the Chronicle palette,
# looked up when it opens.
setup\Explorer.lua
setup\Cleanup.lua
setup\ExplorerWindow.lua

# Upgrade hints in item tooltips and bags
gear\Weights.lua
gear\Evaluate.lua
gear\Prefs.lua
